About the Challenge
Aryabhata Young Innovators Challenge is a nationwide platform designed to inspire school students to think creatively, solve real-world problems and develop innovative technology-driven solutions.

Through AI/ML, Design Thinking, hands-on innovation, expert mentoring and project presentation, students experience the complete innovation journey from identifying a problem to presenting a practical solution.

Giving Wings to your Imagination!


AI/ML
Explore the fundamentals and applications of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning.


Design Thinking
Understand users, define problems, ideate, prototype and improve solutions.


Real-World Impact
Create meaningful solutions that can bring positive change to communities and society.
